[{"answer":"So, hello everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Lou Miller and I'm going to be your tour guide today","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/2.mp3"},{"answer":"as we take this fantastic boat trip around the Tasmanian coast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Before we set off, I just want to tell you a few things about our journey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Our boats aren't huge as you can see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We already have three staff members on board","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and on top of that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/7.mp3"},{"answer":"we can transport a further fifteen people, that's you - around the coastline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/8.mp3"},{"answer":"But please note if there are more than nine people on either side of the boat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/9.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll move some of you over, otherwise all eighteen of us will end up in the sea!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/10.mp3"},{"answer":"We've recently upgraded all our boats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They used to be jet black,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but our new ones now have these comfortable dark red seats and a light-green exterior","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/13.mp3"},{"answer":"in order to stand out from others and help promote our company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/14.mp3"},{"answer":"This gives our boats a rather unique appearance, don't you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We offer you a free lunchbox during the trip","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and we have three types.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Lunchbox 1 contains ham and tomato sandwiches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Lunchbox 2 contains a cheddar cheese roll","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and Lunchbox 3 is salad-based and also contains eggs and tuna.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/20.mp3"},{"answer":"All three lunchboxes also have a packet of crisps and chocolate bar inside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Please let staff know which lunchbox you prefer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure I don't have to ask you not to throw anything into the sea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/23.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't have any bins to put litter in,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but Jess, myself or Ray, our other guide, will collect it from you after lunch","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and put it all in a large plastic sack.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The engine on the boat makes quite a lot of noise so before we head off,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/27.mp3"},{"answer":"let me tell you a few things about what you're going to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/28.mp3"},{"answer":"This area is famous for its ancient lighthouse,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/29.mp3"},{"answer":"which you'll see from the boat as we turn past the first little island.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It was built in 1838 to protect sailors","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/31.mp3"},{"answer":"as a number of shipwrecks had led to significant loss of life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The construction itself was complicated","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/33.mp3"},{"answer":"as some of the original drawings kept by the local council show.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It sits right on top of the cliffs in a very isolated spot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/35.mp3"},{"answer":"In the nineteenth century there were many jobs there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/36.mp3"},{"answer":"such as polishing the brass lamps,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/37.mp3"},{"answer":"chopping firewood and cleaning windows, that kept lighthouse keepers busy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/38.mp3"},{"answer":"These workers were mainly prison convicts until the middle of that century","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/39.mp3"},{"answer":"when ordinary families willing to live in such circumstances took over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of you have asked me what creatures we can expect to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I know everyone loves the penguins,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/42.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're very shy and, unfortunately, tend to hide from passing boats,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/43.mp3"},{"answer":"but you might see birds in the distance, such as sea eagles,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/44.mp3"},{"answer":"flying around the cliff edges where they nest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/45-2023-10-27-08-41-13.mp3"},{"answer":"When we get to the rocky area inhabited by fur seals,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/46.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll stop and watch them swimming around the coast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/48.mp3"},{"answer":"They're inquisitive creatures so don't be surprised if one pops up right in front of you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Their predators, orca whales, hunt along the coastline too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but spotting one of these is rare.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Dolphins, on the other hand,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/52.mp3"},{"answer":"can sometimes approach on their own or in groups as they ride the waves beside us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/52-2023-01-03-00-05-36.mp3"},{"answer":"Lastly, I want to mention the caves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Tasmania is famous for its caves","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and the ones we'll pass by are so amazing that people are lost for words when they see them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They can only be approached by sea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you feel that you want to see more than we're able to show you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/58.mp3"},{"answer":"then you can take a kayak into the area on another day","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and one of our staff will give you more information on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/60.mp3"},{"answer":"What we'll do is to go through a narrow channel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/61.mp3"},{"answer":"past some incredible rock formations","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and from there we'll be able to see the openings to the caves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and at that point we'll talk to you about what lies beyond.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-2-2022-12-19-21-30-15/64.mp3"}]
